# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit: <Dockerfile>.dockerignore overrides the root
# .dockerignore for this build). The image builds from the REPO ROOT, so
# allow-list exactly the two paths the Dockerfile COPYs - this is what stops
# `az acr build ... .` uploading the whole repo (INF-017).
*
!infra/keycloak/phase1-realm/agentic-ai-realm.json
!deploy/keycloak/themes/agentic-ai
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets
**/*.log
